# Power (inputpower track): power modes Économie d'énergie / Équilibré / Performances in Paramètres > Alimentation and
# Réglages rapides (powerprofilesctl; polkit lets the active session switch), battery state for upower-aware apps.
# Screen off uses xset (x11-xserver-utils), touchpad settings use xinput (both in system.list); suspend and the lid
# action are systemd-logind's (aurora-admin power-lid writes a logind.conf.d drop-in).
power-profiles-daemon
upower
